PATENT NOTICE

The Functional Symbiotic Resilience Index (FSRI, Omega) and associated
computational methods are the subject of a pending application before the
United States Patent and Trademark Office, Serial No. 64/121,656, filed
electronically on 29 July 2026.

The serial number is the one preliminarily assigned on filing and is subject
to confirmation on the official filing receipt.

Background rights held by Biome Makers, Inc. cover the microbiome
network-property methods from which the index derives. They are NOT
conveyed by any license in this repository and their use requires a
separate agreement with Biome Makers, Inc.:

  - WO 2021/119528 A1 (PCT/US2020/064668) : evaluating ecological
    disturbance of an agricultural microbiome from network properties of
    organism communities
  - US 2022/0268756 A1 (Appl. No. 17/665,332) : generating and applying
    agronomic indices from microbiome-derived parameters
  - WO 2017/096385 A1 : microbiome-based identification, monitoring and
    enhancement of fermentation processes and products

The patents cover methods. The CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and AGPL-3.0 terms above
cover the paper and the code respectively, and neither grants a patent
license. Commercial deployment of FSRI-based systems may require a
separate patent license. Contact: acedo@biomemakers.com
